{"날짜": "2026-09-17", "시험지명": "이산고_고2_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260917-CL-G2A-2185a792", "문항": {"9": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>이 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>에서 미분가능할 때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>는 상수이다.)</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 9번 · 구간에 따라 다르게 정의된 함수의 미분가능성"}, "11": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">방정식 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>이 열린구간 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>에서 하나의 실근을 갖도록 하는 정수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 개수는?</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 11번 · 사잇값 정리; 실근이 존재하는 구간"}, "20": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">점 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>에서 곡선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext> </mtext><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 그은 두 접선의 접점과 원점을 세 꼭짓점으로 하는 삼각형의 넓이를 구하시오.</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 20번 · 곡선 밖의 한 점에서 그은 접선의 방정식"}, "13": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math>인 두 실수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에 대하여 세 함수</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math></p><p>의 그래프와 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>이 만나는 점을 각각 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></semantics></math>이라 할 때, 삼각형 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 넓이를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, 삼각형 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 넓이를 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>라 하자. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>S</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></semantics></math>일 때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>b</mi></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은? (단, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></semantics></math>는 원점이다.)</p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 13번 · 함수의 극한의 활용"}, "16": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">그림과 같은 다항함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 그래프와 직선 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>에서 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>일 때, 옳은 것만을 &lt;보기&gt;에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?</p><div class=\"fig\"><img src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" style=\"width:67.3mm\"></div><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">ㄱ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"bl\">ㄴ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"bl\">ㄷ. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>&lt;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></div></div></p><p></p></div>", "유형": "기출 16번 · 미분계수의 기하적 의미"}}}